t process on your behalf and keep you informed at every step. Permits typically take between 4 and 16 weeks depending on the council, the complexity of the application, and whether a planning permit is required.","question","Do you handle planning and permits?","Yes, wherever possible. Projects are priced on a fixed-price contract basis, so you know exactly what you're paying before construction begins, with provisional sums clearly itemised for selections not yet finalised.","Do you provide fixed-price quotes?","You'll hear back within one business day — and you'll reach a builder, not a switchboard. The process starts with a no-obligation consultation where we listen to your vision, review your site or existing property, and discuss your budget and timeline. From there we prepare a detailed proposal outlining scope, costings, and a projected build schedule.","What happens after I get in touch?","f4b4768bc65d","contactFormBlock","Send Us A Message","Contact Info","light","ff68cd667a91","heroInner","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/dbc2b4a5f032554b5f5aea0f2de731c02ecc52ce-4000x2500.jpg","Get In Touch","LET'S BUILD TOGETHER","compact","Tell us about your project and we'll come back to you within one business day. Prefer to talk it through? Call us — you'll get a builder, not a switchboard.",{"_156":157,"_158":159},"settings",{"_197":198,"_199":200,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":60,"_206":207,"_208":-5,"_209":210,"_211":163,"_212":-5,"_213":-5,"_214":163,"_215":216,"_217":218,"_219":220,"_221":222,"_223":-5,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_88":228,"_229":230,"_231":232},"navigation",{"_160":161,"_162":163,"_164":165,"_166":167},"footerMenu",[186,187,188,189,190,191],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[174,175,176,177],"socialMenu",[168],{"_169":-5,"_170":171,"_172":173},"icon","label","Instagram","url","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_170":-5,"_179":184,"_180":185},{"_170":-5,"_179":182,"_180":183},{"_170":-5,"_179":12,"_180":181},{"_170":178,"_179":